<Document>
  <name>Texas — Unmapped Historical Markers (statewide)</name>
  <description>Every THC marker in Texas without an HMDB id, excluding isMissing, isPrivate and isActive=False rows. 3263 placemarks across 218 counties (46 on field-verified coords, the rest on THC estimated coords); 900 further markers are omitted for having no coordinate at all. Orange pins (127) are isPending=True — the marker may not be installed yet. Split into 2 folders because Google My Maps caps a layer at 2,000 features.</description>
