  <Placemark>
    <name>Collin McKinney Home</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[Finch Park off S. Benge Street,   McKinney<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> McKinney<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Collin<br/><br/><b>Marker Text:</b> Texas patriot and statesman one of committee of five that wrote the Texas Declaration of Independence, one of its fifty-nine signers, March 2, 1836. Served in House of Representatives, Republic of Texas. In recognition of his distinguished service the county and county seat of Collin County bear his name. Born in New Jersey, April 17, 1766. Died in this house, September 9, 1861.]]></description>
    <Point><coordinates>-96.6185335019489,33.1911611156829,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
