  <Placemark>
    <name>King's Highway - Camino Real - Old San Antonio Road</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[Old Bastrop Highway (CR 266), N side, 0.3 mi. NE of York Creek Rd. Close to Comal-Hays county line. Pink granite marker 76 of 128 placed in 1918.<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> Old Bastrop Highway, New Braunfels<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Comal<br/><br/><b>Marker Text:</b> King's Highway - Camino Real - Old San Antonio Road. Marked by the Daughters of the American Revolution and the State of Texas A.D. 1918]]></description>
