    <Point><coordinates>-97.4575996453879,29.5088726445156,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Fleming T. Wells</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[from Gonzales, take 90 A West about 13.25 miles. Private-no access.<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> Gonzales<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Gonzales<br/><br/><b>Marker Text:</b> Star and Wreath Born in Orange County; purser in the Texas Navy. Secretary to Captain Jeremiah Brown of the Invincible, died June 2, 1844. Erected by the State of texas, 1962]]></description>
