    <name>[PENDING] Edwards-Smith-Ashley House</name>
    <styleUrl>#pending</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>⚠ PENDING — marker may not yet be installed at this location.</b><br/><br/>Marker pending<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> 602 W. Dry St., San Saba<br/><br/><b>County:</b> San Saba]]></description>
    <Point><coordinates>-98.725584,31.194151,0</coordinates></Point>
