    <description><![CDATA[<b>Address:</b> Richland Springs<br/><br/><b>County:</b> San Saba]]></description>
    <Point><coordinates>-98.9449934265251,31.2739163362287,0</coordinates></Point>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Harmony Ridge Community, Site of</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Address:</b> San Saba<br/><br/><b>County:</b> San Saba<br/><br/><b>Marker Text:</b> The original building burned in 2005. The present structure was built in 2007 on the footprint of the original building.]]></description>
