    <name>Williamson Creek Cemetery</name>
    <styleUrl>#normal</styleUrl>
    <description><![CDATA[Little Texas Ln., N side between Mira Dr. and I-35 South frontage road. HTC medallion on post is near southeast corner of the cemetery near entrance.<br/><br/><b>Address:</b> 1000 Little Texas Ln., Austin<br/><br/><b>County:</b> Travis]]></description>
